1️⃣ What is Dead Letter Queue (DLQ)?

When a consumer fails to process a message after retries →
👉 Send that message to a separate topic (DLQ)

Normal Flow
Kafka Topic → Consumer → Success ✅

Failure Flow
Kafka Topic → Consumer → Fail ❌ → Retry → Fail ❌ → DLQ
2️⃣ Why DLQ is Needed?
❌ Without DLQ

Message keeps failing forever

Blocks processing

Data lost or stuck

✅ With DLQ

Failed messages isolated

System continues working

Can debug later

